# <Project Name> — shared environment configuration
# Copy this file to .env in the repository root and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit .env — it is excluded by .gitignore.
#
# This file covers every application in the workspace. An app that doesn't use a given
# variable simply ignores it — one file, not one per app (see docs/standards/git.md).

# --- <example service> ---
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
# EXAMPLE_ENDPOINT=

# --- Local development ---
# Variables that a local dev-startup script sets automatically (see
# docs/development/local-platform.md if you have one) don't need to be set here — the
# script injects them as process environment variables before each child process starts.
